implementationPlan.description:
In `dashboard/src/components/policy/PolicyReplay.tsx` line 104-107, change:
```typescript
const { data: jobsData, isLoading: jobsLoading } = useJobs({
    perPage: limit,
    sort: "-createdAt",
});
```
To:
```typescript
const { data: jobsData, isLoading: jobsLoading } = useJobs({
    limit,
});
```
The `limit` property exists on `JobFilters` and maps correctly to the backend `?limit=N` query param. Backend returns most-recent first by default.
